# AI development workflow (Development OS) — local only, not shipped with the app
#
# NOTE the shape of the project-docs rule. It must be `/project-docs/*` (a wildcard over the
# DIRECTORY'S CHILDREN), never a bare `/project-docs/`: git refuses to descend into an excluded
# directory, so with the bare form every negation below it is silently inert and the exceptions
# cannot possibly take effect. Re-excluding the children individually afterwards is what makes the
# two carve-outs real.
/pipeline/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# ...but two things under project-docs/ are CODE, not process records, and stay tracked:
#   - project-docs/project-manifest.yaml  the process identity: frozen_paths AND the test_gate
#                                        suite registry. Losing it silently disarms every gate.
#   - project-docs/evidence/**/*.py        the regression harnesses themselves (10 suites /
#                                        369 assertions). They are the project's only test
#                                        code; untracked they cannot be reviewed, reverted,
#                                        shared, or reproduced on another machine.
#
# Shape matters twice over here, and both mistakes were made and measured on this repo:
#  1. `/project-docs/*`, never a bare `/project-docs/`. Git refuses to descend into an excluded
#     directory, so every negation beneath a bare `/project-docs/` is silently inert.
#  2. `/project-docs/evidence/*` re-excludes the CHILDREN but then re-admits the directories
#     (`!/project-docs/evidence/*/`), because `/project-docs/evidence/**` would exclude
#     `REQ-EXT-FILE-001/` itself -- and git cannot reach `.../REQ-EXT-FILE-001/dedup_e2e.py`
#     through an excluded directory, so the trailing `!**/*.py` never fires. Hence the
#     extensions are enumerated instead of using a blanket exclusion.
# Net effect: harness sources tracked, every log / report / json under evidence still local.
/project-docs/*
!/project-docs/project-manifest.yaml
!/project-docs/evidence/
/project-docs/evidence/*
!/project-docs/evidence/*/
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.log
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.txt
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.md
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.json
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.png
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.diff
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.patch
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.cpp
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.out
/project-docs/evidence/**/*.sql
/project-docs/evidence/manifest
/project-docs/evidence/REPORT*

